rders without routing through the authorized execution owner.', 'required_prevention_controls': ['fail-safe order mutation authority routing'], 'reopen_condition': 'fail-safe order mutation routing or owner changes'}, {'canonical_id': 'FC-CLOUD-SYNC-LIVE-RUNTIME', 'aliases': ['G-012'], 'root_cause_code': 'cloud-synced live runtime state', 'root_cause_aliases': ['クラウド同期ライブ状態'], 'root_cause_description': 'Live runtime state depends on a cloud-synchronized path or file identity.', 'required_prevention_controls': ['local canonical live runtime state'], 'reopen_condition': 'live runtime persistence path or sync semantics change'}, {'canonical_id': 'FC-CROSS-DAY-EVIDENCE-LOSS', 'aliases': ['G-013'], 'root_cause_code': 'cross-day evidence loss', 'root_cause_aliases': ['日跨ぎ証拠消失'], 'root_cause_description': 'Evidence required across trading days is not durably persisted.', 'required_prevention_controls': ['cross-day durable evidence persistence'], 'reopen_condition': 'cross-day evidence persistence or retention changes'}, {'canonical_id': 'FC-POSITION-OWNERSHIP-LEAKAGE', 'aliases': ['G-014'], 'root_cause_code': 'position ownership leakage', 'root_cause_aliases': ['ポジション所有権漏洩'], 'root_cause_description': 'Orders or exits can act on quantity not owned by PHOENIX.', 'required_prevention_controls': ['PHOENIX-owned quantity boundary'], 'reopen_condition': 'position ownership attribution or quantity boundary changes'}, {'canonical_id': 'FC-LIVE-SCALABILITY-DIVERGENCE', 'aliases': ['G-015'], 'root_cause_code': 'live scalability divergence', 'root_cause_aliases': ['ライブスケーラビリティ乖離'], 'root_cause_description': 'Validated workload or scalability assumptions diverge from the live execution workload.', 'required_prevention_controls': ['live workload equivalence proof'], 'reopen_condition': 'live workload, universe, cadence, or capacity assumptions change'}]

